{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"个性化算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/algorithms/collaborative-filtering","wordCount":2508,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-based-methods","title":"内容推荐方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/algorithms/content-based-methods","wordCount":2324,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-recommendation-models","title":"深度推荐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/algorithms/deep-recommendation-models","wordCount":2815,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"个性化算法\">个性化算法</h1><h2 id=\"本章概览\">本章概览</h2><p>个性化算法是个性化引擎的核心驱动力，本章深入三大主流算法方向：协同过滤（从行为相似性挖掘隐式偏好）、内容方法（从商品属性和语义特征出发）、深度推荐模型（融合多维信号的端到端学习）。掌握这三类算法的原理与工程权衡，是实现高质量个性化推荐的基础。</p>\n<p>本章包含三篇文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"collaborative-filtering\">协同过滤进阶</a>：从矩阵分解到神经协同过滤，深入CF算法族的原理与实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"content-based-methods\">内容推荐方法</a>：基于商品属性和语义嵌入的内容推荐技术</li>\n<li><a href=\"deep-recommendation-models\">深度推荐模型</a>：Wide&amp;Deep、DIN、DIEN等工业级深度模型详解</li>\n</ul>\n"}